<view class="welcome-page">
  <image class="welcome-mark" src="/assets/brand-mark.png" mode="aspectFit" />
  <view class="page-title">灵感拾光簿</view>
  <view class="welcome-copy">记下一个想法，慢慢补充。需要时，整理成一份可以带走的文字。</view>
  <button class="btn btn-block" bindtap="onStart">记录我的想法</button>
  <button class="btn btn-quiet btn-block" open-type="share">分享给微信好友</button>
  <view class="welcome-hint">分享到朋友圈，可用右上角菜单。</view>
</view>
